   <text:p text:style-name="P115" loext:marker-style-name="T52"><text:span text:style-name="T52">After this, the screen that is displayed is what you will normally see when you login. The screen has an entry for each app that you have uploaded. It has an </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T48">Upload App</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T52"> button that can be used to upload new versions of the same app or to upload a new app.<text:line-break/></text:span></text:p>
