   <text:p text:style-name="P60" loext:marker-style-name="T52"><text:span text:style-name="T52">A review screen will be displayed which should list the name to be assigned to the device along with the UDID associated with the device. Review to ensure this is correct and press </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T48">Register</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T52">.</text:span></text:p>
