   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T34"><text:span text:style-name="T34">Click on the build number and you will be taken to a page where you can click on </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T38">Provide Export Compliance Information</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T34">. The app uses an encryption algorithm to protect the text of the app. </text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P91" loext:marker-style-name="T34"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T34"><text:span text:style-name="T34">Click </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T38">Yes</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T34"> to the first dialog that the app uses encryption and then click </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T38">Next</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T34">.</text:span></text:p>
