   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T74"><text:span text:style-name="T74">At the time the key is created, a .p8 file is generated which can be used for all apps. <text:s/>You are allowed to make two keys through this interface, so that you can create a new key and revoke the old one, but only one is active at a time. <text:s/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T74"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P111" loext:marker-style-name="T74"/>
